{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3115030/extras/6edc60d5109d48f64ac1f84eccd31340.avif?t=1761222864\" width=1370 height=187 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CUBO </strong>combines the familiar mechanics of the Magic Cube with a story-driven, adventure-puzzle world. Explore a beautifully crafted environment, unlock new areas, and meet mysterious creatures as you journey through a fractured world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3115030/extras/adef2559f73d3f421cc80723fef7c9be.avif?t=1761222864\" width=1370 height=187 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>  </strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>  </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3115030/extras/fa71b126cfd92c07d2c62c14bbf3e5cf.poster.avif?t=1761222864\" width=792 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3115030/extras/fa71b126cfd92c07d2c62c14bbf3e5cf.webm?t=1761222864\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3115030/extras/fa71b126cfd92c07d2c62c14bbf3e5cf.mp4?t=1761222864\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover the hidden sides of a cube-shaped world, each featuring different biomes filled with unique challenges and secrets. Travel across the Overworld and also within the cube\u2019s interior to uncover new areas. Gain new abilities and mechanics that allow you to traverse previously unreachable tiles and uncover new paths.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3115030/extras/3559b083fa2be1b035e1717ce1caa66b.avif?t=1761222864\" width=1370 height=158 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3115030/extras/db6a5fc950766b75809fff92632131fa.poster.avif?t=1761222864\" width=796 height=292 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3115030/extras/db6a5fc950766b75809fff92632131fa.webm?t=1761222864\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3115030/extras/db6a5fc950766b75809fff92632131fa.mp4?t=1761222864\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Progress through the game by unlocking new tiles and cube faces, revealing the full extent of the world. Use and combine previously discovered tiles to solve puzzles and advance through the game, rewarding creative exploration.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3115030/extras/9013588b965135f7dc70042a522fc3dc.avif?t=1761222864\" width=1370 height=158 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover the story of a world torn apart by natural imbalance. With the Cubewalker, it\u2019s your role to connect what was fractured. Piece together the world\u2019s fragmented history and restore harmony to nature by solving puzzles tied to the very fabric of the environment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3115030/extras/a747155d7366c58c8ec9095512ec3cf9.avif?t=1761222864\" width=1370 height=158 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3115030/extras/051f6f101be5440e70fefded10d10dc2.poster.avif?t=1761222864\" width=800 height=248 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3115030/extras/051f6f101be5440e70fefded10d10dc2.webm?t=1761222864\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3115030/extras/051f6f101be5440e70fefded10d10dc2.mp4?t=1761222864\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in a fully hand-painted world inspired by the artistry of Studio Ghibli. The game\u2019s visual style evokes a sense of wonder and tranquility, similar to games like Journey and Gris. Each environment is lovingly crafted to create a beautiful, emotional, and wholesome experience.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3115030?t=1761222864","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3115030?t=1761222864","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3115030/b70faab37db941048887aff3c63688db12cb8e05/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761222864","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3115030/b70faab37db941048887aff3c63688db12cb8e05/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761222864","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Captions available","id":13},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":